### =====================================================================
### Smart Lost & Found - REST Client requests
### VS Code: install "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request"
### Run the demo seed first:  python -m scripts.seed_demo --reset
### =====================================================================

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@studentToken = PASTE_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Meta (enums, matching weights, upload limits)
GET {{api}}/meta

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTH
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login as admin (JSON - use this one)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@campus.edu", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Login as student
# @name studentLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@campus.edu", "password": "Student@123" }

### Login (OAuth2 form - what Swagger uses)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin@campus.edu&password=Admin@123

### Register a new student
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newstudent@campus.edu",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "full_name": "New Student",
  "roll_number": "24BCS99999",
  "department": "CSE"
}

### Current user
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### CATALOG
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### All categories
GET {{api}}/categories

### Category + its form schema
GET {{api}}/categories/calculator

### Just the fields
GET {{api}}/categories/bottle/fields

### Location tree
GET {{api}}/locations/tree

### Search locations
GET {{api}}/locations?q=Block%20B

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### REPORTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create a LOST report (matching runs immediately)
# @name createLost
POST {{api}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "LOST",
  "category_key": "calculator",
  "title": "Black scientific calculator",
  "public_description": "Black Casio fx-991EX with a small scratch near the display.",
  "hidden_detail": "Red dragon sticker inside the cover",
  "attributes": { "brand": "Casio", "colour": "Black", "model": "fx-991EX", "has_case": true },
  "location_id": 11,
  "occurred_at": "2026-10-27T09:20:00Z"
}

### Create a FOUND report (this triggers the match)
# @name createFound
POST {{api}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "FOUND",
  "category_key": "calculator",
  "title": "Calculator found in Block B",
  "public_description": "Black scientific calculator, small scratch near the display.",
  "attributes": { "brand": "Casio", "colour": "Black", "model": "fx-991EX", "has_case": true },
  "location_id": 11,
  "occurred_at": "2026-10-27T09:30:00Z",
  "deposited_location_id": 27
}

### List my reports
GET {{api}}/reports?mine=true&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Filter: found reports in the library
GET {{api}}/reports?type=FOUND&q=library
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Report detail
GET {{api}}/reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Matches for a report (owner or admin)
GET {{api}}/reports/1/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Upload a photo
POST {{api}}/reports/1/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="calculator.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./calculator.jpg
------Boundary--

### Close a report
POST {{api}}/reports/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Found it myself" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### CLAIMS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Claim a matched item
POST {{api}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "match_id": 1,
  "answers": {
    "hidden_detail": "red dragon sticker",
    "questions": [
      { "q": "What unique marking is on it?", "a": "a red dragon sticker inside the cover" }
    ]
  }
}

### My claims
GET {{api}}/claims/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### NOTIFICATIONS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### My notifications
GET {{api}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Unread count
GET {{api}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Mark all read
POST {{api}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### ADMIN
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Dashboard counters (24 / 17 / 9 / 6 after seeding)
GET {{api}}/admin/stats/today
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verification queue
GET {{api}}/admin/verification-queue?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All matches
GET {{api}}/admin/matches?status=SUGGESTED&min_score=65
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Match detail WITH score breakdown
GET {{api}}/admin/matches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Confirm a match
POST {{api}}/admin/matches/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Owner described the sticker correctly" }

### Reject a match
POST {{api}}/admin/matches/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Different model" }

### Pending claims
GET {{api}}/admin/claims?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve a claim
POST {{api}}/admin/claims/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Verified at the security desk" }

### Reject a claim
POST {{api}}/admin/claims/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Details did not match" }

### Users
GET {{api}}/admin/users?q=aarav
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Promote a user to STAFF
PATCH {{api}}/admin/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "STAFF" }

### Audit log
GET {{api}}/admin/audit-log
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
